*~
.DS_Store

# Note: b2_description/meshes/ and dae/ are tracked on purpose -- the URDF
# references package://b2_driver_description/meshes/.  They are also byte
# identical duplicates of each other (163 MB each); see README if that ever
# needs trimming.  Listing them here would do nothing, since .gitignore does
# not affect files git already tracks.
